oomol/oo-mistral-ai  1.0.3 -> 1.0.4
change_type: instructions   changelog: - Operates Mistral AI through the OOMOL-connected `mistral_ai` connector using the `oo` CLI. - Supports chat, agents, conversations, FIM completions, embeddings, OCR, moderation, and audio transcription. - Manages Mistral Agents, versions, aliases, libraries, documents, files, batch jobs, fine-tuning jobs, and models. - Includes clear read, write, and destructive action guidance, with schema inspection before payload construction. - Uses server-side credential injection so raw Mistral API tokens

